    <chapter>
      <label id="reference"/>
      <heading>Developer Reference</heading>
      <p>OnTheWing is a standard WebObjects 4.5 application, though the project uses the <uref url="https://github.com/gnustep/libs-gsweb">GNUstep Web</uref> project for deployment.</p>
      
      <section>
        <heading>Component Classes</heading>
        <list>
          <item><ref type="class" id="Main"/></item>
          <item><ref type="class" id="BrowseJournal"/></item>
        </list>
      </section>

    </chapter>

    <back>
